No dynamic loader (docs/w4.md W4d). JavaScriptCore names the version of
its bytecode cache after the build ID of the library it is in, which it
finds by asking the dynamic loader where that library was loaded
(dladdr, dl_iterate_phdr). A Kosmos image is static and nothing loads
it but Nebula, so there is no dlfcn.h, and the version is the build's
timestamp, as it already is on Haiku and QNX.

--- a/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/JSCBytecodeCacheVersion.cpp	2026-11-11 23:56:29.053420876 -0300
+++ b/Source/JavaScriptCore/runtime/JSCBytecodeCacheVersion.cpp	2026-11-11 23:56:29.070775627 -0300
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@
 #include <wtf/NeverDestroyed.h>
 #include <wtf/text/SuperFastHash.h>
 
-#if OS(UNIX)
+#if OS(UNIX) && !OS(KOSMOS)
 #include <dlfcn.h>
 #if OS(DARWIN)
 #include <mach-o/dyld.h>
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
